---
source: crates/vps-ready/src/cli/module_docs.rs
expression: out
---
user.admin
  Set up an admin account that logs in with an SSH key and uses sudo
  Does not apply to this host: the admin account is set up only on Debian and
  Ubuntu so far.
  Arms the safety timer: confirm from a new SSH session.

ssh.server
  Turn off root and password logins over SSH
  Does not apply to this host: sshd is set up only on Debian and Ubuntu so far.
  Arms the safety timer: confirm from a new SSH session.

firewall.inbound
  Drop incoming traffic that no rule allows
  Does not apply to this host: the firewall is set up only on Debian and Ubuntu
  so far.
  Arms the safety timer: confirm from a new SSH session.

ssh.bruteforce
  Ban addresses that keep failing to log in over SSH
  Does not apply to this host: fail2ban is set up only on Debian and Ubuntu so
  far.

kernel.sysctl
  Harden kernel settings
  Does not apply to this host: kernel settings belong to the host inside a
  container.

updates.auto
  Install security updates automatically
  Does not apply to this host: apt is supported only on Debian and Ubuntu.

